          <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px]"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-muted grid place-items-center text-[10.5px] font-semibold">📊</span><span>Uptime monitoring</span></div>
